1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,080
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) Lily was playing a computer game.

2
00:00:03,940 --> 00:00:07,260
Random people online are grouped in fives.

3
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:10,180
They all play against each other.

4
00:00:11,020 --> 00:00:13,320
You can also talk to the other players.

5
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:17,420
Lily noticed that someone had sent her a

6
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:17,960
message.

7
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:20,520
She clicked on the inbox.

8
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:23,740
It was from someone she did not know.

9
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:26,400
The person said, hi.

10
00:00:27,080 --> 00:00:28,320
It was a guy.

11
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:32,340
She was deciding whether or not to reply.

12
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:35,640
Her mom always said not to talk to

13
00:00:35,640 --> 00:00:38,920
strangers, but her dad said every friend was

14
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:39,800
once a stranger.

15
00:00:40,740 --> 00:00:41,980
She said hi.

16
00:00:42,660 --> 00:00:44,940
The guy asked where she was from.

17
00:00:45,660 --> 00:00:48,220
She told him she was from Los Angeles.

18
00:00:48,960 --> 00:00:50,820
He was from there too.

19
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:53,640
They turned out to be from the same

20
00:00:53,640 --> 00:00:54,580
math class.
